WEBVTT

00:24:27.760 --> 00:24:31.356
anyone going in or out of the city
could see the lights.

00:24:31.380 --> 00:24:33.106
That night, Charles got a message

00:24:33.130 --> 00:24:35.956
from a police officer
who works at the Pentagon.

00:24:35.980 --> 00:24:37.693
CH: He had just finished his shift.

00:24:37.717 --> 00:24:38.870
He was walking back.

00:24:38.894 --> 00:24:41.120
He saw it, and he just
wanted to say, "Thanks."

00:24:41.144 --> 00:24:43.702
He said, "This was
the first positive thing

00:24:43.726 --> 00:24:45.066
I've seen in a while."

00:24:45.090 --> 00:24:47.216
AG: Their community
started to take notice.

00:24:47.240 --> 00:24:48.846
Other hotels followed suit.

00:24:48.870 --> 00:24:50.564
The local news picked up the story,

00:24:50.588 --> 00:24:52.419
and people started calling the hotel,

00:24:52.443 --> 00:24:56.326
hoping for a sneak preview
of what shape the lights would take next.

00:24:56.350 --> 00:24:57.825
CH: It turned into this moment

00:24:57.849 --> 00:25:00.203
where we all had something
to be happy about again